    "ja": "自作LU・三角解法で固定4行列を分解し、binary32因子とbinary64残差の5回改良を独立有理数解へ照合します。",
    "en": "Original LU and triangular solves on four fixed matrices compare five refinement steps, using binary32 factors and binary64 residuals, with exact-rational solutions."
  },
