  "limitations": {
    "ja": "全スケールでの安定性・任意の高条件数系の収束を保証せず、binary64再構成の増大率とbinary32補正因子を区別。",
    "en": "No guarantee for arbitrary scaling or convergence on every ill-conditioned matrix. Binary64 reconstruction growth is distinct from the binary32 correction factor."
  },
