          "ja": "SPD12、低ランク近特異8、Hilbert5、Wilkinson12を固定。binary32因子・三角解法とbinary64残差・補正の5回です。",
          "en": "Fixed SPD matrix of size 12, a nearly singular rank-one matrix of size 8, Hilbert matrix of size 5 and Wilkinson matrix of size 12. Factors and triangular corrections use binary32; residuals use binary64, with five updates."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "手書き部分ピボットLU・下三角Cholesky・前後代入。",
          "en": "Original implementations of LU with partial pivoting, lower Cholesky factorization and triangular substitution."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "実binary64入力をFraction有理数で厳密に解き、別のLAPACK DGESV/DPOSVへ照合。条件数・前進誤差・後退誤差を分離。 保存する有理数参照ベクトルは、厳密Fraction解の各成分をbinary64へ丸めたものです。",
          "en": "Exact-rational solutions for the actual binary64 inputs and separate LAPACK DGESV/DPOSV comparisons. Conditioning, forward error and backward error are reported separately. Each saved reference component is the exact Fraction solution rounded to binary64."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "小さい固定例のみ。一般の高条件数系で混合精度の収束は保証しません。",
          "en": "Small fixed examples only; convergence of mixed-precision refinement is not guaranteed for arbitrary matrices."
        },
        "review_level": {
          "ja": "入力・16独立参照・195科学判定は旧版から不変。R4科学実行の実際の成否はresult.json/verification.jsonへ記録し、旧失敗と別に保持します。",
          "en": "The fixed inputs, 16 independent reference checks and 195 scientific gates are unchanged. R4 passed the primary validation; actual package checks are recorded in result.json and verification.json. Earlier failed attempts remain separate."
        },
        "formulas": [
          "PA=LU",
          "A=LL^T",
          "x_(j+1)=x_j+solve_factor32(b-A*x_j)"
        ],
